### Cadastrar cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/cliente/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Cliente Teste",
    "email": "cliente@teste.com",
    "senha": "Cliente@123",
    "cpf": "12345678901",
    "dataNascimento": "2000-05-15"
}


### Login de cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/cliente/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "cliente@teste.com",
    "senha": "Cliente@123"
}